"releaseNotes":"The robot’s adventure has arrived!\n\nThis new update to LEGO® Builder’s Journey answers many of your burning questions. What happened to the robot? Why was he abandoned in the cave? Who is he, really?\n\nJoin the robot on his incredible journey and discover what happened to him before, during, and after the events of LEGO Builder’s Journey. Discover new locations and a new way of playing as you get a glimpse inside his head. Literally.\n\nGo explore with your new robot friend today!", "artistId":347363505, "artistName":"LEGO", "genres":["Games", "Puzzle"], "primaryGenreName":"Games", "primaryGenreId":6014, "bundleId":"com.lego.games.arthouse", "trackId":1441636691, "trackName":"LEGO® Builder's Journey", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "sellerName":"LEGO System A/S", "releaseDate":"2019-12-19T08:00:00Z", "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2025-05-21T06:02:55Z", "version":"4.0.0", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"A story about play, connections and adventure.\n\n====\n\n“What a game. I love it.” – Eurogamer\n\n“a peaceful, intelligent, and nostalgic work of art” – Games Radar\n \n“Light Brick Studios has proven itself to be capable of great things.” – Touch arcade\n\n“It’s a simple tale, but touching in its way. And it feeds directly into the relaxing atmosphere.” – The Verge\n\n“an astoundingly polished debut from Lego’s new studio” -EDGE Magazine\n\n====\n \nStep through levels brick by brick with puzzles that ask us to sometimes follow the instructions… and sometimes to be creative and break the rules.\n \nBuilder’s Journey is a poetic puzzle that takes place in a LEGO® brick world, brought to life with the most accurately rendered LEGO® elements yet to feature on screens. Be taken through a breathtaking world filled with brick-by-brick effects, accompanied by a beautiful soundtrack.\n \nThroughout the narrative, there will be ups and downs, challenges and celebrations. Take the time to experiment, and most importantly, to play as figuring out who we are and what we become is the Builder’s Journey.", "minimumOsVersion":"13.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.283970000000000055706550483591854572296142578125, "fileSizeBytes":"1568468992", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":1148, "trackContentRating":"4+", "languageCodesISO2A":["AR", "DA", "NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "KO", "PT", "RU", "ZH", "ES", "TR"], "averageUserRating":4.283970000000000055706550483591854572296142578125, "trackCensoredName":"LEGO® Builder's Journey", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/lego-builders-journey/id1441636691?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "genreIds":["6014", "7012"], "userRatingCount":1148}, 
